    <bpmn:process id="W_W4537" name="W4537. Captive Underwriting Policy, Guidelines &amp; Risk Acceptance" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Structure (W4530); annual review; new risk line
Frequency: Annual + on change
Volume: Captive underwriting policy across in-scope risk lines
Owner: Risk (VS-21.2) / Captive Board Underwriting Committee
Participants: Insurance (VS-26), Actuarial, Legal (VS-100.3), Compliance (VS-22)
Source: workflow W4537 — Captive Underwriting Policy, Guidelines &amp; Risk Acceptance</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4537_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4537_Lane1" name="Risk">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4537_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4537_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4537_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4537_Lane2" name="Compliance">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4537_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4537_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4537_Start4" name="Structure (W4530); annual review; new risk line">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4537_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4537_Task5" name="Risk/Captive Board set the underwriting policy (which risks/lines the captive…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Risk/Captive Board set the underwriting policy (which risks/lines the captive writes, limits, retentions, exclusions, territories/entities covered), per the W4530 scope &amp; risk appetite (VS-21.2)
Responsible (R): Risk / Captive Board UW Committee
Accountable (A): Captive Board
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4537_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4537_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4537_Task6" name="Risk/Actuarial set risk-acceptance criteria &amp; underwriting guidelines…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Risk/Actuarial set risk-acceptance criteria &amp; underwriting guidelines (eligibility, limits, deductibles, pricing parameters), and the underwriting authority/delegation
Responsible (R): Risk / Actuarial
Accountable (A): Head of Internal Audit &amp; Risk / Captive Board
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4537_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4537_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4537_Task7" name="Compliance/Legal ensure the policy aligns to domicile/regulatory rules and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Compliance/Legal ensure the policy aligns to domicile/regulatory rules and risk-transfer requirements, and report to the captive board
Responsible (R): Compliance / Legal
Accountable (A): VP Legal / Captive Board
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4537_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4537_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4537_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4537_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4537_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-112 (ensure captive risk-transfer adequacy.) | - CTL-690: underwriting policy board-approved &amp; scope-limited (VS-21.2); risk-transfer compliant; concentration capped
Owner: Risk (VS-21.2) / Captive Board Underwriting Committee</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W4537_Assoc10" sourceRef="W4537_Annotation9" targetRef="W4537_Start4" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4537_Flow11" sourceRef="W4537_Start4" targetRef="W4537_Task5" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4537_Flow12" sourceRef="W4537_Task5" targetRef="W4537_Task6" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4537_Flow13" sourceRef="W4537_Task6" targetRef="W4537_Task7" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4537_Flow14" sourceRef="W4537_Task7" targetRef="W4537_End8" />
    </bpmn:process>
