    <bpmn:process id="W_W4538" name="W4538. Program Rating, Premium Pricing &amp; Actuarial Valuation" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Policy cycle (W4537); renewal; actuarial review
Frequency: Annual + on change
Volume: Premium pricing/rating across in-scope risk lines
Owner: Actuarial / Risk (VS-21.2) / Treasury (VS-18)
Participants: Insurance (VS-26), Tax (VS-79/W4535), Captive Board
Source: workflow W4538 — Program Rating, Premium Pricing &amp; Actuarial Valuation</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4538_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4538_Lane1" name="Actuarial">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4538_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4538_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4538_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4538_Lane2" name="Captive Board">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4538_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4538_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4538_Start4" name="Policy cycle (W4537); renewal; actuarial review">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4538_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4538_Task5" name="Actuarial develop the rating/pricing for each captive program (loss-cost +…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Actuarial develop the rating/pricing for each captive program (loss-cost + expense + risk-load + capital-load), based on loss history &amp; exposure data (VS-21.2/VS-26)
Responsible (R): Actuarial / Risk
Accountable (A): Head of Internal Audit &amp; Risk / Captive Board UW Committee
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4538_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4538_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4538_Task6" name="Actuarial/Tax set arm&#x27;s-length premium (transfer-pricing-compliant W4535)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Actuarial/Tax set arm&#x27;s-length premium (transfer-pricing-compliant W4535), benchmark vs commercial market, and document the actuarial indication
Responsible (R): Actuarial / Tax
Accountable (A): Head of Internal Audit &amp; Risk / CFO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4538_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4538_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4538_Task7" name="Captive Board/Actuarial approve rates, document the valuation, and file where…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Captive Board/Actuarial approve rates, document the valuation, and file where required by domicile
Responsible (R): Captive Board / Actuarial / Legal
Accountable (A): Captive Board
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4538_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4538_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4538_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4538_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4538_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-690 (ensure controlled execution — Captive Underwriting, Risk Transfer &amp; Reinsurance Program (PA-153.2).) | - CTL-690: rates actuarially indicated &amp; board-approved; arm&#x27;s-length (W4535); documented &amp; filed
Owner: Actuarial / Risk (VS-21.2) / Treasury (VS-18)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W4538_Assoc10" sourceRef="W4538_Annotation9" targetRef="W4538_Start4" associationDirection="None" />
