    <bpmn:process id="W_W4539" name="W4539. Policy Issuance, Fronting &amp; Ceding to Captive" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Renewal (VS-26); new entity/risk; go-live (W4536)
Frequency: Per policy/renewal (annual lines)
Volume: Policies across 5 entities, in-scope risk lines
Owner: Insurance (VS-26) / Risk / Fronting carrier (W4534)
Participants: Finance (VS-17), Legal (VS-100.3), Treasury (VS-18)
Source: workflow W4539 — Policy Issuance, Fronting &amp; Ceding to Captive</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4539_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4539_Lane1" name="Insurance">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4539_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4539_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4539_Lane2" name="Fronting Carrier">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4539_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4539_Lane3" name="Finance">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4539_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4539_End9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4539_Start5" name="Renewal (VS-26); new entity/risk; go-live (W4536)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4539_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4539_Task6" name="Insurance/Fronting carrier issue the master/local policies to BuildRight…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Insurance/Fronting carrier issue the master/local policies to BuildRight entities (admitted paper), per the W4537 underwriting policy &amp; W4538 rates
Responsible (R): Insurance / Fronting Carrier
Accountable (A): Head of Internal Audit &amp; Risk / Insurance Manager
Duration: Per policy</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4539_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4539_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4539_Task7" name="Fronting carrier/Risk cede the in-scope risk to the captive…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Fronting carrier/Risk cede the in-scope risk to the captive (quota-share/excess, per W4540 reinsurance), and record the cession/premium transfer
Responsible (R): Fronting Carrier / Risk / Treasury
Accountable (A): Head of Internal Audit &amp; Risk / CFO
Duration: Per policy</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4539_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4539_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4539_Task8" name="Finance/Treasury account the premium/cession (premium flow, commission to…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Finance/Treasury account the premium/cession (premium flow, commission to fronting, captive premium income), per VS-17/W4535 intercompany
Responsible (R): Finance / Treasury
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Per policy</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4539_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4539_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4539_End9" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4539_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4539_Annotation10">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-690 (ensure controlled execution — Captive Underwriting, Risk Transfer &amp; Reinsurance Program (PA-153.2).) | - CTL-690: policies issued per UW policy (W4537); cessions reconciled; premium accounted (VS-17/W4535)
Owner: Insurance (VS-26) / Risk / Fronting carrier (W4534)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W4539_Assoc11" sourceRef="W4539_Annotation10" targetRef="W4539_Start5" associationDirection="None" />
