    <bpmn:process id="W_W4540" name="W4540. Reinsurance Program Design &amp; Treaty Placement" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Structure (W4530); renewal; capacity need
Frequency: Annual + on change
Volume: Captive reinsurance program (treaty/facultative)
Owner: Risk / Treasury (VS-18) / Captive Board / Broker
Participants: Actuarial, Insurance (VS-26), Reinsurers, Legal (VS-100.3)
Source: workflow W4540 — Reinsurance Program Design &amp; Treaty Placement</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4540_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4540_Lane1" name="Risk">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4540_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4540_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4540_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4540_Lane2" name="Treasury">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4540_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4540_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4540_Start4" name="Structure (W4530); renewal; capacity need">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4540_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4540_Task5" name="Risk/Actuarial/Broker design the reinsurance program (excess-of-loss…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Risk/Actuarial/Broker design the reinsurance program (excess-of-loss cat/property treaty, quota-share, facultative for large risks) protecting the captive above its retention (W4530)
Responsible (R): Risk / Actuarial / Broker
Accountable (A): Head of Internal Audit &amp; Risk / Captive Board
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
