    <bpmn:process id="W_W4544" name="W4544. Underwriting Performance Monitoring &amp; Cycle Management" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Quarterly; renewal; cycle shift
Frequency: Quarterly + annual
Volume: Captive underwriting performance across programs
Owner: Risk / Captive Board / Actuarial
Participants: Finance (VS-17), Insurance (VS-26), Treasury (VS-18)
Source: workflow W4544 — Underwriting Performance Monitoring &amp; Cycle Management</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4544_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4544_Lane1" name="Actuarial">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4544_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4544_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4544_Lane2" name="Risk">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4544_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4544_Lane3" name="Captive Board">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4544_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4544_End9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4544_Start5" name="Quarterly; renewal; cycle shift">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4544_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4544_Task6" name="Actuarial/Finance measure underwriting performance (loss-ratio, expense-ratio…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Actuarial/Finance measure underwriting performance (loss-ratio, expense-ratio, combined ratio, captive result) per program/period, vs pricing (W4538)
Responsible (R): Actuarial / Finance
Accountable (A): Head of Internal Audit &amp; Risk / Captive Board
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4544_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4544_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4544_Task7" name="Risk/Captive Board interpret results vs cycle (hard/soft market, cat activity)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Risk/Captive Board interpret results vs cycle (hard/soft market, cat activity), adjust retention/pricing/reinsurance (W4538/W4540), and manage the cycle
Responsible (R): Risk / Captive Board
Accountable (A): Captive Board
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4544_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4544_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4544_Task8" name="Captive Board/CFO report performance to the group board (VS-36), with…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Captive Board/CFO report performance to the group board (VS-36), with dividend/capital-return decisions when results/surplus allow
Responsible (R): Captive Board / CFO
Accountable (A): Board
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4544_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4544_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4544_End9" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4544_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4544_Annotation10">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-690 (ensure controlled execution — Captive Underwriting, Risk Transfer &amp; Reinsurance Program (PA-153.2).) | - CTL-690: underwriting result monitored (loss/combined ratio); cycle managed; distributions capital-adequacy-gated (W4533)
Owner: Risk / Captive Board / Actuarial</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
